<section class="space-y-6">
  <header class="space-y-2">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Effective date: <%= effectiveDate %></p>
  </header>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Who runs this service</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Job Hunter is run as an individual or small-project software service, not as a large corporation.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">What the service does</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">The service automates job discovery, AI scoring, duplicate detection, email reporting, and CV-to-job comparison workflows.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">No guarantees</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>No guarantee that jobs are available, accurate, current, or relevant.</li>
      <li>No guarantee of interviews, responses, or offers.</li>
      <li>No guarantee of uninterrupted uptime or perfect AI judgments.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Your responsibilities</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>Provide lawful, accurate inputs and account details.</li>
      <li>Do not upload content you do not have rights to use.</li>
      <li>Do not abuse provider APIs, scraping sources, or rate limits.</li>
      <li>Keep your account and credentials secure.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Third-party services</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">This product may rely on Paddle, OpenAI or Anthropic, Apify and job data providers, Resend/email providers, and public sites such as LinkedIn or ATS boards. Their own terms and policies apply.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Payment modes</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>Hosted credits mode: paid usage via Paddle.</li>
      <li>Bring-your-own-key mode: free app usage, provider charges paid directly by you.</li>
      <li>Self-hosted mode: non-commercial use of the GitHub code, with your own infrastructure and security responsibilities.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Credits and fees</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Credits are a prepaid usage balance. Hosted mode pricing includes usage costs and a separate 10% service fee, while Paddle/payment processing fees are also charged as applicable.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Acceptable use</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>No resale of hosted access.</li>
      <li>No commercial replication of the self-hosted code.</li>
      <li>No bulk scraping abuse or automated misuse.</li>
      <li>No attempts to bypass limits, billing, or controls.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">AI limitation</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">AI output may be incomplete or wrong. You are responsible for decisions made from job matches, summaries, and CV analysis.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Suspension or termination</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Access may be limited or suspended for abuse, non-payment, confirmed fraud, or unresolved chargebacks.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Liability cap</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Where allowed by law, total liability is limited to the amount you paid for hosted service in the most recent billing period.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Terms may be updated over time. Changes are published on this page with an updated effective date.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>
  </section>
</section>
